    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d225-a3">

                <pb facs="0329" n="223" xml:id="pg223"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 223.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCreery to Mr.
                            Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November 5,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I herewith transmit for your information a
                    copy of a communication I have to-day received from the governor of the province
                    of Valparaiso in relation to the case of Patrick Shields, a fireman of American
                    steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Keweenaw</hi>.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. B. McCreery</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>P. S.—I have not yet heard from the judge of crime in reference to the above
                        matter.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d225-a3-a1.xml" xpointer="d225-a3-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
